# Tests must be necessary and fast

- Cover the behaviour the ticket promised. Do not add extra cases, snapshots, or a second test that fills the same form.
- Type with `setupUser()` from the web `test-utils` (delay null). Never `userEvent.setup()` with the default delay.
- Query the exact field. `getByLabelText(/name/i)` also matches Full name. Use `getByRole("textbox", { name: /^name/i })`.
- Do not raise a timeout to hide slow typing.
